msgid "Using the debugger in your favorite Python IDE"
msgstr "Korišćenje debagera u vašem omiljenom Python IDE-u"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/develop.rst:360
msgid ""
"It is possible to use the builtin debugger in your favorite Python IDE, if "
"it supports remote debugging. The first step is to add the calibre src "
"checkout to the ``PYTHONPATH`` in your IDE. In other words, the folder you "
"set as ``CALIBRE_DEVELOP_FROM`` above, must also be in the ``PYTHONPATH`` of"
" your IDE."
msgstr ""
"Moguće je koristiti ugrađeni debager u vašem omiljenom Python IDE-u, ako "
"podržava udaljeno debagovanje. Prvi korak je da dodate calibre src checkout "
"u ``PYTHONPATH`` u vašem IDE-u. Drugim rečima, fascikla koju ste postavili "
"kao ``CALIBRE_DEVELOP_FROM`` iznad, mora takođe biti u ``PYTHONPATH`` vašeg "
"IDE-a."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/develop.rst:365
msgid ""
"Then place the IDE's remote debugger module into the :file:`src` sub-folder "
"of the calibre source code checkout. Add whatever code is needed to launch "
"the remote debugger to calibre at the point of interest, for example in the "
"main function. Then run calibre as normal. Your IDE should now be able to "
"connect to the remote debugger running inside calibre."
msgstr ""
"Zatim postavite modul udaljenog debagera IDE-a u :file:`src` podfasciklu "
"calibre izvornog koda. Dodajte bilo koji kod koji je potreban za pokretanje "
"udaljenog debagera u calibre na mestu od interesa, na primer u glavnoj "
"funkciji. Zatim pokrenite calibre normalno. Vaš IDE bi sada trebalo da bude "
"u mogućnosti da se poveže sa udaljenim debagerom koji radi unutar calibre-a."

